      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَآءَسَ</span></b>  <i>He feigned the lowliness,</i> or <i>submissiveness, of poverty, humbling,</i> or <i>abasing, himself,</i>
(K,* TA,) with men; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَأَّسَ</span></b>  is allowable in
the same sense. (TA.)

